rooms_desc ({"You are standing in a shadey alley, much like dozens of other identicalones in the area.  Ahead of you is an entrance to what looks like asmall, closed warehouse.  All of the windows are boarded up, and thereis a sign on the door that reads 'Closed'.","After knocking the secret passcode, you are quickly slipped inside of thebuilding.  The inside of the building appears to be much better conditionthen the outside would lead you to believe.  Another small sign herethat catches your attention.","This is the main hall of the Den.  Many thieves are lounging here,trading tips and information, stories of great exploits, andtheories of how to rob the bank of Holy Mission.  There are severalchoices of tables and bean-bag chairs to pick from, but youthink of your coins and reconsider staying in this room too long.","You stand in a medium sized kitchen, which appears to be very wellequiped with many large cabinets with full stocks of incredablyexpensive foods.  The Den cook is furiously preparing dinner forCirith and his guests.","The dining room has an incredably large table set in the middle of it,with finely crafted wooden chairs lining around the edges.  Manycabinets are also against the wall, holding beautiful china andsilverware.  The smell of food drifts from the north.","Many strange models, practice dummies, lock-picks, locks and otheritems with less obvious uses are in this room.  There are severalthieves here, practicing skills and making wagers on the peopleworking with the equipment.","This is the safe room that Cirith stores his personal equipment in.Only he may enter this room!",0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"Entrance","Inside","Main Hall","Kitchen","Dining room","Recreation Room","Safe room",0,0,0,})
